 "<div style=\"font-family:'Montserrat', sans-serif;font-size:56px;font-weight:800;color:#ffb347;line-height:1\">160<span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#a9bdd3\"> m</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:6px\">de altura</div>": "<div style=\"font-family:'Montserrat', sans-serif;font-size:56px;font-weight:800;color:#ffb347;line-height:1\">160<span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#a9bdd3\"> m</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:6px\">high</div>",
 "<div style=\"font-family:'Montserrat', sans-serif;font-size:56px;font-weight:800;color:#ffb347;line-height:1\">218<span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#a9bdd3\"> m</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:6px\">de largo</div>": "<div style=\"font-family:'Montserrat', sans-serif;font-size:56px;font-weight:800;color:#ffb347;line-height:1\">218<span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#a9bdd3\"> m</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:6px\">long</div>",
 "Un clic: la oruga recorre la pista en seis segundos (una trayectoria recta). La ecuación es un objeto de ecuación (LaTeX). Distancia y velocidad aproximadas.": "One click: the crawler covers the track in six seconds (a straight motion path). The equation is an equation object (LaTeX). Approximate distance and speed.",
 "T−48 H": "T−48 H",
 "El traslado, a paso de tortuga": "The move, at a snail's pace",
 "La oruga lleva el cohete de pie, sin que se incline ni un grado en la cuesta.": "The crawler carries the rocket upright, without tilting even one degree on the slope.",
 "Crawler": "Crawler",
 "Clic: arranca": "Click: go",
 "La torre y, abajo, el transbordador pequeño. En la siguiente diapositiva el mismo modelo viaja y crece con Transformar.": "The tower and, below, the small shuttle. On the next slide the same model travels and grows with Transform.",
 "Mobile Launcher (assembled)": "Mobile Launcher (assembled)",
