 "Cierre con la lámpara girando sola al revés (velocidad negativa). Créditos de los modelos con licencia CC BY abajo; la botella, el aguacate y el farol son CC0.": "Closing with the lamp turning by itself backwards (negative speed). Credits for the CC BY models at the bottom; the bottle, the avocado and the lantern are CC0.",
 "Ahora, a fotografiar": "Now, time to shoot",
 "Elige una muestra, coloca dos luces y busca el ángulo donde el material se luce más.": "Pick a sample, place two lights and find the angle where the material looks its best.",
